{"id":"882ddfff5f1c7a82","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-lindenbaum.md","title":"Lindenbaum's Lemma","display":"Lindenbaum's Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-lindenbaum","aliases":["93-thm-lindenbaum"],"display":"Lindenbaum's Lemma","depends_on":["[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-theory]]","[[93-df-consistency]]","[[93-df-maximal-theory]]","[[93-df-complete-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-lindenbaum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-lindenbaum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Lindenbaum's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf7108c33537548a\" href=\"?note=cf7108c33537548a\" title=\"93-df-theory\">93-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"959f67178eec388a\" href=\"?note=959f67178eec388a\" title=\"93-df-consistency\">93-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8bbd77b21a9519f1\" href=\"?note=8bbd77b21a9519f1\" title=\"93-df-maximal-theory\">93-df-maximal-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1bb65160feb13df8\" href=\"?note=1bb65160feb13df8\" title=\"93-df-complete-theory\">93-df-complete-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-lindenbaum-—-Lindenbaum's-Lemma\">thm-lindenbaum — Lindenbaum's Lemma</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula set, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\\)</span> is a finitary structural logic, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}\\)</span> is the unindexed logic predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}\\)</span> is the maximal-consistent-theory predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8bbd77b21a9519f1\" href=\"?note=8bbd77b21a9519f1\" title=\"93-df-maximal-theory\">93-df-maximal-theory</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists B\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)\">\\(\\exists B\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)\\)</span>；有限前提集可生成整个公式集。该条件用于最大非平凡理论的链上界构造。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lindenbaum}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists B\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq F\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(U,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lindenbaum}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists B\\in[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq F\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(U,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在这里 Cons₉₃ 表示不导出所有公式。有限性逐结论成立并不足以排除一致理论链的并生成顶理论；新增的有限生成顶理论条件使该上界论证成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-lindenbaum-—-Lindenbaum's-Lemma","text":"thm-lindenbaum — Lindenbaum's Lemma","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-finite-subset","status":"resolved","id":"6b63f2f43b5511ee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-finite-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"cf7108c33537548a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"959f67178eec388a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8bbd77b21a9519f1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-maximal-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-complete-theory","status":"resolved","id":"1bb65160feb13df8","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-complete-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Logic}$ is the unindexed logic predicate of [[93-df-logic]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-maximal-theory","status":"resolved","id":"8bbd77b21a9519f1","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}$ is the maximal-consistent-theory predicate of [[93-df-maximal-theory]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists B\\in[F]^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lindenbaum}\\vdash\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\Bigl(\\exists B\\in[F]^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall\\chi\\in F\\;(B\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\chi)\\Bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cons}_{93}(T,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\exists U\\subseteq F\\;\\bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{MaxTh}_{93}(U,\\mathcal L)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1451,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6b63f2f43b5511ee","bd7e4207897c8db3","cf7108c33537548a","959f67178eec388a","8bbd77b21a9519f1","1bb65160feb13df8"]}